# tests/ folder

Integration tests live here. Do not add unrelated test files.

- `holder.test.ts` — GAINE test holder verification against MariaDB
- `waitlist.test.ts` — community waitlist persistence and network applications
- `reflection.test.ts` — GAINE reflection preference save and routing API (holder → beneficiary)

Shared fixtures live in `tests/fixtures/`. When adding coverage, extend the relevant file above — avoid scattering new `*.test.ts` files.

Run: `npm test`
